sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as AgentState
    participant PM as Product Manager
    participant AR as Arquitecto
    participant DEV as Developer
    participant QA as QA Tester
    participant REV as Code Reviewer

    Note over S: init: problem_statement, function_signature, test_cases
    S->>PM: invoke
    PM->>S: write prd
    S->>AR: invoke
    AR->>S: write design_doc
    S->>DEV: invoke
    DEV->>S: write code_artifact
    S->>QA: invoke (sandbox subprocess)
    QA->>S: write test_results
    S->>REV: invoke
    Note over REV: verdict derived from test_results
    REV->>S: write review_comments
    REV->>DEV: revision (only self_reflection, if REQUEST_CHANGES)
    REV->>S: END (if APPROVE or max revisions)